   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Il y a»: ago",
     "texto": [
      "**Il y a** + time = ago (already past): **Je suis arrivé il y a deux jours** (I arrived two days ago)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Depuis»: since (and still going)",
     "texto": [
      "**Depuis** + time = for (and still ongoing): **J'habite ici depuis deux ans** (I've been living here for two years). With **depuis** the present tense is used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Pendant»: duration",
     "texto": [
      "**Pendant** + time shows how long something lasts. In a past story it can name a finished duration (**Je suis resté pendant trois jours**); it also works for a future period: **Je serai absent pendant deux jours** (I will be away for two days)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
